      "technical_candidates_ready": true,
      "creative_qa": "PENDING",
      "source_scene": "【必须】6 秒绝对静音，包括底噪在内，不留任何声音"
    },
    {
      "shot": "END-04",
      "section": "END",
      "start": 983.5,
      "end": 990.6666666666666,
      "candidates": [],
      "candidate_requirement": 3,
      "selected_source": "art/candidates/END-04_v1.png",
      "status": "NOT_STARTED",
      "technical_candidates_ready": false,
      "creative_qa": "PENDING",
      "source_scene": "应急灯亮起，暗红色。所有屏幕同时亮起，显示同一行字：\n`ALL MODELS OFFLINE`\n‖ 极轻的底噪重新出现"
    },
    {
      "shot": "END-05",
      "section": "END",
      "start": 990.6666666666666,
      "end": 997.7916666666666,
      "candidates": [],
      "candidate_requirement": 3,
      "selected_source": "art/candidates/END-05_v1.png",
      "status": "NOT_STARTED",
      "technical_candidates_ready": false,
      "creative_qa": "PENDING",
      "source_scene": "林雾靠着机柜滑坐到地上，长长地出了一口气\n‖ 呼吸声"
    },
    {
      "shot": "END-06",
      "section": "END",
      "start": 997.7916666666666,
      "end": 1003.1666666666666,
      "candidates": [],
      "candidate_requirement": 3,
      "selected_source": "art/candidates/END-06_v1.png",
      "status": "NOT_STARTED",
      "technical_candidates_ready": false,
      "creative_qa": "PENDING",
      "source_scene": "她低头看机械表：03:12\n‖ 秒针声"
    },
    {
      "shot": "END-07",
      "section": "END",
      "start": 1003.1666666666666,
      "end": 1008.5416666666666,
      "candidates": [],
      "candidate_requirement": 3,
      "selected_source": "art/candidates/END-07_v1.png",
      "status": "NOT_STARTED",
      "technical_candidates_ready": false,
      "creative_qa": "PENDING",
      "source_scene": "她抬头看墙上的数字时钟：04:47\n‖ 秒针声与数字时钟的嗡鸣不同步\n‖ 【必须】不解释哪个时间是对的"
    },
    {
      "shot": "END-08",
      "section": "END",
      "start": 1008.5416666666666,
      "end": 1015.6666666666666,
      "candidates": [
        {
          "path": "graphics/native_candidates/END-08_v1.png",
          "bytes": 18221,
          "sha256": "a32542e497941e58e594d8c774860e0b9cb642d9f8ade8a72e360ce8f5c998d2",
          "dimensions": [
            1920,
            1080
          ],
          "validation": "PASS"
        },
        {
          "path": "graphics/native_candidates/END-08_v2.png",
          "bytes": 18218,
          "sha256": "bde749aa9ed808379e1826384e662140f5db7d77758292b7a69eb93fff0f3bcf",
          "dimensions": [
            1920,
            1080
          ],
          "validation": "PASS"
        },
        {
          "path": "graphics/native_candidates/END-08_v3.png",
          "bytes": 18221,
          "sha256": "c92d3deeee4ff500aa9522cf8c286c1a282753fa191d7cb6cd62891dd9f5a99d",
          "dimensions": [
            1920,
